==== LEDs ====
Front LEDs can be controlled using OpenWrt [[:docs:guide-user:base-system:led_configuration|led configuration]]. Rear (ethernet) LEDs can be switched off using the following commands that can be added to ''/etc/rc.local'':
<code>
#led switch off
mdio mt7530-0 0:0x1f raw 0x21 0x0008

#restore led function
#mdio mt7530-0 0:0x1f raw 0x21 0x000b
</code>
This depends on ''mdio-tools'' package.

